    }
  }
}
```

- Monitor CloudTrail for unusual Braket job creation followed by IAM policy attachment events
- Monitor CloudTrail for Braket job creation by principals who do not usually create Braket jobs
- Monitor CloudTrail for roles being passed to Braket that haven't been used before
- Monitor and alert on Braket job creation with privileged roles
